  "records": {
    "description": "Very small splitter array, slices are 6x8 and the frontend is 5 wide.",
    "features": [
      "8 splitters",
      "No status outputs from the slices which is why its so small, uses a counter in the frontend to keep track of the array."
    ],
    "negatives": "- Slow distribution\n- Basically no hopperlocking\n- No unstackable separation, instead you must use a device that checks the output boxes for unstackables and removes said unstackables",
    "instructions": [
      "Put boxes in the input and it splits them for you",
      "There is no second step"
    ]
